        <h2>Short Courses vs Long-term Study: What's the Difference?</h2>
        <p>The rules differ depending on how long you plan to stay.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
        <div style="padding: 1.8rem 1.6rem; background: var(--white); border-radius: 14px; border: 2px solid #86efac; position: relative;">
